@startuml scfen-wire
' SPEC: _spec/apps/ui/starchess/scfen-wire.puml
' purpose: SCFEN wire string and the roles of each optional/required field.
!include ../../../themes/proveo.puml

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left

title SCFEN · Wire Format & Field Roles

database "SCFEN|<placement>|<turn>|\n<wlives><blives>|<phase>|G:<wGas><bGas>:<wInc><bInc>|[|Q:...][|U:...][|S:...][|H:...][|M:...]" as WIRE <<db>>

component "G: vespene + income" as G <<app>>
component "Q: planning queue" as Q <<async>>
component "U: specials-used squares\nthis turn" as U <<db>>
component "S: sieged rook squares" as S <<db>>
component "H: legacy king-checks" as H <<db>>
component "M: mines" as M <<db>>

WIRE ARROW_MAIN G : carries
WIRE ARROW_OPTIONAL Q : carries
WIRE ARROW_OPTIONAL U : carries
WIRE ARROW_OPTIONAL S : carries
WIRE ARROW_OPTIONAL H : carries
WIRE ARROW_OPTIONAL M : carries

note right of WIRE
  Required: placement, turn, lives, phase, ""G:"".
  Optional: ""Q:"" ""U:"" ""S:"" ""H:"" ""M:"".
  Omitted ""Q:"" = snapshot-only snapshot.
end note

note right of G
  **Remaining vespene** + this turn's income/cap.
  Income must equal the turn tier (1 / 2 / 3).
  Gas does **not** accumulate — ""endScTurn"" refills
  to full income next turn.
end note

note right of Q
  Planning queue; omit = snapshot-only.
  Shape: scfen-queue.puml.
end note

note right of S
  Sieged rook squares (""S:c3f7"").
  Unpacked tanks are **immobile** until ""rookSiege""
  toggles tank mode.
end note

note right of H
  Legacy pending king-checks (""H:b:n:c5e4"").
  Parsed for round-trip; **unused** by ""endScTurn""
  (checks are implicit legal geometry).
end note

note right of M
  Mines ""M:w:c3d4;b:f5"" (max 2 / side).
  Not FEN pieces.
end note

note bottom
  **King-shot intent:** classical actions encode ""to"" as **intent**
  (often the enemy king square). Resolve may retarget; optional history
  ""C=from intentTo>resolvedTo"".
end note
@enduml
